      en: ["The country house was completed in 1797 for Captain Juan Javier Mijares.", "Simón Bolívar stayed here for the last time in Caracas in July 1827.", "It has operated as the Museum of Colonial Art since its inauguration in 1961.", "The estate was originally part of a large plantation named 'Anauco'.", "The kitchen remains fully preserved with 18th-century cooking implements.", "It was officially designated as a National Historic Monument on January 24, 1970."],
